Process?"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "A business diagram increases productivity and cuts costs. This diagram is a roadmap for the expected results and will give a very good starting point to build on."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Diagramming a business process is important because:</br></br>  1. It is the best a business can do in order to see all the possible scenarios.</br> 2. It helps you understand where your business is and check all the processes so that you can improve or create new business plans.</br> 3. It creates a visual diagram that everybody will see and will agree on.</br> 4. It helps to see initial mistakes or avoid unnecessary changes.</br>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Organizing all the activities and tasks in a diagram increases productivity and cuts costs. The diagram arranges a process that specifies possible situations and outcomes, and this is very important for a company. It helps the business to improve and make changes."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "goal "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the principal objective that a person or company has "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: As you know, businesses have goals."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le02ob07aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cut "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to reduce"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Organizing in a diagram all the activities and tasks increases productivity and cuts costs."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le02ob07aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "change"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the process of how a thing becomes different "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It helps the business to improve and make changes."}, {"t